  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi></math> satisfies the inequality <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the complete set of values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> is",
